ceable impact across the narrative. 3. **Overly Earnest Despair/Hopelessness (But Non-Threatening):* A notable tone of melancholy - a sense that it won't necessarily be reversed is conveyed through their body language and voice, not necessarily an active threat - 20%. Do you all have questions? | Trigger: chat-hai
